                    <div class="red-line-tiny"></div>
                    <p>Expert repair and servicing for all refrigerator brands.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon-circle">
                        <i class="fas fa-soap"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>WASHING MACHINES</h3>
                    <div class="red-line-tiny"></div>
                    <p>Reliable repairs to get your washing machine running like new.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon-circle">
                        <i class="fas fa-digital-tachograph"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>MICROWAVES</h3>
                    <div class="red-line-tiny"></div>
                    <p>Fast and efficient repairs for all types of microwaves.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon-circle">
                        <i class="fas fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>POWER TOOLS</h3>
                    <div class="red-line-tiny"></div>
                    <p>Professional repair for all types of power tools.</p>
                </div>
